#: ../gparted.appdata.xml.in.h:1
msgid ""
"GParted is a free partition editor for graphically managing your disk "
"partitions."
msgstr ""
"GParted is 'n gratis verdeling redakteur vir grafies die bestuur van jou "
"skyf partisies."

#: ../gparted.appdata.xml.in.h:2
msgid ""
"With GParted you can resize, copy, label, and move partitions without data "
"loss. These actions enable you to grow or shrink your C: drive, create space "
"for new operating systems, or attempt data rescue from lost partitions."
msgstr ""
"Met GParted jy kan die grootte, kopieer, etiket, en beweeg partisies sonder "
"data verlies. Hierdie aksies in staat stel om te groei of krimp jou C: ry, "
"skep ruimte vir nuwe bedryf stelsels, of probeer data redding van verlore "
"partisies."

#: ../gparted.appdata.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
"GParted works with many file systems including: btrfs, ext2, ext3, ext4, "
"fat16, fat32, hfs, hfs+, linux-swap, lvm2 pv, nilfs2, ntfs, reiserfs, "
"reiser4, udf, ufs, and xfs."
msgstr ""
"GParted werke met baie lêer stelsels insluitend: btrfs, ext2, ext3, ext4, "
"fat16, fat32, hfs, hfs+, linux-swap, lvm2 pv, nilfs2, ntfs, reiserfs, "
"reiser4, udf, ufs, and xfs."

